ISO-10303-21;
/* Le004: \X\ single-byte ISO-8859 escape with bad hex digit count or non-hex input; \X\HH must consume exactly two upper-case hex digits; defects: one digit (\X\F), three digits (\X\009), lowercase (\X\e9), non-hex (\X\GG), or whitespace interposed (\X\E9 9); strict parser emits E_BAD_X_DIRECTIVE; tolerant reader may accept lowercase by case-folding but must reject odd or non-hex digit counts; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty */
